graph TD
    Request[Sync Request<br/>Date Range] --> CheckExisting{Existing Data<br/>in State?}
    
    CheckExisting -->|Yes| Hit1[Cache Hit<br/>existingData]
    CheckExisting -->|No| CheckMemory{Memory Cache<br/>TTL 60s<br/>30s for today}
    
    CheckMemory -->|Hit| Hit2[Cache Hit<br/>MemoryCacheAdapter]
    CheckMemory -->|Miss| CheckIDB{IndexedDB Cache<br/>Persistent<br/>TTL 5min}
    
    CheckIDB -->|Hit| Hit3[Cache Hit<br/>IndexedDbCacheAdapter]
    CheckIDB -->|Miss| CheckServer{Server Cache<br/>TTL 5min<br/>ETag support}
    
    CheckServer -->|Hit| Hit4[Cache Hit<br/>ServerCacheAdapter]
    CheckServer -->|Miss| Fetch[Network Request<br/>tryFetch<br/>Circuit Breaker]
    
    Fetch --> SaveMemory[Save to Memory<br/>TTL 60s]
    Fetch --> SaveIDB[Save to IndexedDB<br/>TTL 5min]
    Fetch --> SaveServer[Update Server Cache<br/>ETag]
    
    SaveMemory --> Return[Return Data]
    SaveIDB --> Return
    SaveServer --> Return
    
    Hit1 --> Return
    Hit2 --> Return
    Hit3 --> Return
    Hit4 --> Return
    
    Return --> SWR{SWR Enabled?<br/>Stale-While-Revalidate}
    
    SWR -->|Yes| Background[Background Revalidation<br/>Update cache async]
    SWR -->|No| Complete[Complete]
    
    Background --> Complete

    style Request fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1e40af,color:#fff
    style Hit1 fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    style Hit2 fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    style Hit3 fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    style Hit4 fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    style Fetch fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#d97706,color:#fff
    style Return fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#fff
    style Complete fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1e40af,color:#fff

